# v0.27 round 67 (Sprint 1, googleplay C-P0-9): 兜底防 keystore 误 commit
# (android/.gitignore 已排除 *.jks / *.keystore / key.properties, 这里是
# root 层兜底 — 万一用户把 keystore 移到根目录或 .gradle 目录, 也能拦住)
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties

# v0.27 round 73 (重构-2): 设计师迭代产物 / 100 个 variations 候选不进 git
# 实际只上架用: assets/brand/app_icon_master.png + app_icon_maskable.png
# + icon_showcase.html。其他 100 variations + _v2..v5 迭代 + icon_preview_v2..v5
# 已 git mv 到 assets/brand/_archive/ (R42 报告 M6 落地, 节省 ~10 MB git objects)
# .gitignore 兜底: 设计师后续新加的 _v6 / variations_k.png 自动不 commit
assets/brand/_archive/
assets/brand/variations/
assets/brand/*_v[2-9]*.png
assets/brand/icon_preview_v[2-9]*.png
